  "name": "A Brief Message",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/A_Brief_Message",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-14T09:01:15.618Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "To the Conductor:"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-0f0a11c4ef5790e6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Please forgive me for leaving without notice. I know you're doing all you can to recover the car belonging to me and (Trailblazer)."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-d53ce9c8860cbf79"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I wanted to say goodbye before leaving, but the difference in time flow between the outside world and Amphoreus no longer permitted me to stay."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b60a10638168119b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I saw the look in your eyes. It was the same one I saw when you spoke of Mr. Mikhail and the others."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-1ae60272b3846462"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I didn't want to trouble you with unnecessary worry, so I'm leaving this message."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-cee9292e27652b6e"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I'll bring both of them back safe and sound."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-2592a8c9e8751b3f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "This is my promise. You know me. I never break my word. This is also the duty I carry as an Express \"Guard.\""
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-d71c6ef3aa5cc925"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I don't know how long this will take. If you ever feel anxious, read this message. Maybe it will ease your mind, even if just a little."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-74237c569c658834"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If (Trailblazer) were here, they would probably say there's still mung bean soda in the fridge that they hasn't finished and wouldn't want to waste."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-93c302ca3c12909f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Please look after March until she wakes up. Goodbye."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-65cc54bf9dd00ead"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Dan Heng"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-854f9fc5589bbea8"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
